# Local data directory for MovieMind.
#
# Everything under data/ is intentionally NOT tracked in git.
# data/raw/     holds the TMDb snapshot fetched via the official API.
#               TMDb grants free NON-COMMERCIAL use with mandatory attribution,
#               but does NOT grant redistribution rights, so the snapshot must
#               not be committed. It is fully regenerable by running
#               scripts/fetch_tmdb_snapshot.py with your own free API key.
# data/audit/   holds generated audit output (also untracked).
